{
  "id": "ISA.66",
  "number": "66",
  "bookId": "ISA",
  "reference": "Isaya 66",
  "copyright": "© 2021 KENBS",
  "verseCount": 24,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "66",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ISA 66"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "66",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omonene okonachera abanto b’ebisaku ekiina",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aya nar’Omonene agoteeba: “Igoro nero ekerogo kiane ki’obonene, na ense negeteni kiane ki’amagoro; inyomba ki moranyare kong’agachera? Gose ng’ai aase are ndanyare gotimokera?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebinto ebi bionsi ninche nabitongete, ase ayio bionsi pi bikabao. Korende omonto ore omoitongo, ore nomokia bw’ogweitia ase engencho y’ebibe biaye, na okoiguswa ase ring’ana riane, oyio nere ndarigererie.” Nab’Omonene atebiire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Oyo okonyenya eng’ombe nere oyio ogoita na omonto, na oyo okorua emaanwa y’eng’ondi koba ekeng’wanso nere oyio okobuna esese ebigoti; oyo okorua okoruegwa kw’endagera nere oyio okorua amanyinga ’embeche, na oyo ogosamba ubani nere oyio ogosesenia omogwekano bw’ogosasimwa. Abanto abwo bachorire chinchera chiabo abanyene, na emioyo yabo nigo egokerete ayio bagokora ay’okogechia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio nainche nimbachorere amaakwa abo na kobarentera obwoba, ekiagera ekero nabarangeretie, onde taitabete, na ekero nakwanete, onde tategererete; nigo bakorete ayarenge amabe ase obosio bwane, nigo bachorete gokora aya atangogeti.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ogotooreka kwa Yerusalemu omoyia, na obonene bwaye",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inwe aba mokoiguswa ase ring’ana ri’Omonene, igwa ring’ana riaye: “Abamino abaabagechete na kobaseria ase engencho y’erieta riane batebiire iga: Tiga Omonene aegwe obonene, erinde torore omogooko oino. Korende barabwo abanyene mbasookigwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tegerera moigwe okwoga kore ase omochie ime. Igwa eriogi rikorwa ase Hekalu! Erio neriogi ri’Omonene ekero akoa ababisa baye egesusuro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Omochie oyio onga buna omokungu okoibora atarachaka kobina; ekero konya ataraba nobororo bw’okobina, akaibora omwana omoisia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ning’o ona‐koigwa amang’ana anga buna ayio? Ning’o ona‐korora amang’ana anga buna ayio? Inee! Ense nenyare koiborwa ase rituko erimo? Gose egesaku nkeiborwe ara rimo? Korende ekero omochie o Sayoni ochagete kobina okaibora abana baye erio kegima.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene nigo agoteeba iga: “Inee! Ninkore engaki y’okoibora eike, ko abana tibaiborwa? Naende Nyasae nigo agoteeba iga: Inee! Inche nimbe oyo okorua chinguru abana baiborwa, naende ninsieke enda teibora?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Inwe abamwanchete Yerusalemu,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "yogokere na koyochenga!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nainwe mwensi aba mokoyoreera,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "goka amo noro na gochenga!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bono gonka na moisaneke namabeere aye,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "monyore okoremigwa ase egekuba kiaye;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "ee, gonka mono na mogokere obonge bw’obonene bwaye!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aya nar’Omonene agoteeba: “Naama! Nimente ogosesenigwa ase Yerusalemu kobe buna orooche, ninyorentere na obotenenku bw’ebisaku bobe orooche rwaichoire amaache, erinde mogonke, naende moimokigwe mobekwe kwaa, moagatwe na gochanchimwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buna ng’ina agochanchima omwana, naboigo nainche nkobachanchima inwe; ee, nabo morachanchimwe agwo Yerusalemu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero morarore amang’ana ayio, mosasoke ase chinkoro chiaino; amauga ’emebere yaino nareerete buna obonyansi oborere; erio abanto mbamanye ng’a okoboko kw’Omonene nigo kore amo nabasomba baye, naende ng’a ekeririanda kiaye nigo kere igoro y’ababisa baye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aya arabe ase engaki y’omoerio",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Rora, Omonene nachiche nomorero, ne chigari chiaye chi’esegi chire buna ekembugu‐mbugu. Nigo araarente endamwamu yaye ere nobotindi na ogotogonyera kwaye kore ne chimeme chi’omorero.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene nanachere abanto ekiina na kobaa egesusuro ki’ogosaambwa nomorero na goitwa nemioro, na abwo baraitwe n’Omonene nigo barabe abange.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Omonene nigo agoteeba iga: Abanto bagweatanana na gwechena ase ogosasiima ime ase ebigondo bagotang’anwa noyomo ore ase egatigati yabo, abwo bakoria enyama y’embeche, na eye chimbeba, na ey’okogechia konde gwonsi, abwo bonsi mbasirigwe amo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inche Omonene nigo imanyete emeremo yabo, na ebirengererio biabo. Ninchiche gosangereria abanto b’ebisaku bionsi abagokwana emenwa ao ao, nabarabwo mbache barore obonene bwane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimbeeke ekemanyererio ase egati y’abwo; abande b’abwo baratooreke nimbatome bagende ase abanto b’ebisaku, bagende Tarisisi, na ase abanto ba Puli na Ludi, abwo bamanyete korasa nemegwe, bagende Tubali na Yavani, na ase ebisinka ne chinse chi’enyancha chire aare, ase abanto batana koigwa chinkuma chiane, na agwo mbaabararerie abanto b’ebisaku obonene bwane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abwo mbarusie abanto bamino korwa ase ebisaku bionsi, erio baabarente ase ’nde inche Omonene buna bakorenta okoruegwa kw’endagera. Nigo barabariinie chibarasi, ne chigari, na ebirogo bi’okobabogoreria, ne chibarasi, ne chingamia, mbaabarente Yerusalemu, ase egetunwa kiane egechenu. Nigo barabarente buna Abaisraeli bakorenta okoruegwa kw’endagera kore ime ase ebikorero ebichenu, bakorenta ase enyomba yane.” Nab’Omonene atebiire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende Omonene oteebire: “Nimbeeke abande b’abwo babe abakuani na Abalawi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Buna koreng’ana igoro chiragenderere kobeera ase obosio bwane, naboigo ne chinderia chiaino chiragenderere kobao amo nerieta riaino boigo.” Nab’Omonene atebiire. Naende oteebire iga:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Korwa omoyega bw’Omotienyi Omoyia goika oyo bw’Omotienyi onde Omoyia, na korwa Esabato goika Esabato ende, abanto bonsi mbache gosasiima ase obosio bwane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero barasoke isiko mbarore emebere ekwete y’abanto abwo basaretie korwa ase ’nde inche Omonene. Amakonde arabe akoria emebere yabo tagokwa, na omorero orabe okobasamba tokorima. Abwo bakwete mbabe okogechia okobe ase abanto bonsi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
